From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:00:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kk: refuse a texel buffer view in a format with no texel
 buffer entry

kk_CreateBufferView read kk_get_va_format()'s entry unchecked. A format
with no entry reports no texel-buffer features, so the Vulkan spec makes
such a view the application's error, but The Witcher 3's D3D12 renderer
made one through vkd3d-proton 22 s into its start and the NULL entry was
read (kk_CreateBufferView+0x50, addr 0xa), killing the game. Name the
format, its range, the buffer's usage and the features the driver
reports as `[kk-bufview] refused ...` (16 lines at most), and return
VK_ERROR_FORMAT_NOT_SUPPORTED.

Linear: PLA-452
Class: upstream-bug
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-27-witcher3-avx.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c
index c5e73bc..47426d4 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c
@@ -7,6 +7,8 @@
 
 #include "kk_buffer_view.h"
 
+#include <stdio.h>
+
 #include "util/format/u_format.h"
 
 #include "kk_buffer.h"
@@ -68,6 +70,28 @@ kk_CreateBufferView(VkDevice _device, const VkBufferViewCreateInfo *pCreateInfo,
    enum pipe_format p_format = vk_format_to_pipe_format(view->vk.format);
    const struct kk_va_format *supported_format = kk_get_va_format(p_format);
 
+   /* Playport (PLA-452): a format with no texel-buffer support has no entry,
+    * and the Vulkan spec makes such a view the application's error. The
+    * Witcher 3's D3D12 renderer made one through vkd3d-proton and the NULL
+    * entry was read here; name it and refuse it instead. */
+   if (!supported_format) {
+      static unsigned refused;
+      if (refused++ < 16)
+         fprintf(stderr,
+                 "[kk-bufview] refused VkFormat %d (%s): no texel buffer format; "
+                 "offset=%llu range=%llu elements=%llu buffer usage=0x%llx "
+                 "features=0x%llx\n",
+                 (int)view->vk.format, util_format_name(p_format),
+                 (unsigned long long)view->vk.offset,
+                 (unsigned long long)view->vk.range,
+                 (unsigned long long)view->vk.elements,
+                 (unsigned long long)view->vk.buffer->usage,
+                 (unsigned long long)kk_get_buffer_format_features(
+                    kk_device_physical(dev), view->vk.format));
+      vk_buffer_view_destroy(&dev->vk, pAllocator, &view->vk);
+      return vk_error(dev, VK_ERROR_FORMAT_NOT_SUPPORTED);
+   }
+
    /* If we reached here, we support reading at least */
    enum mtl_texture_usage usage = MTL_TEXTURE_USAGE_SHADER_READ;
    if (supported_format->texel_buffer.write)
